---
// Twitter (X) Recommendation Algorithm & Heavy Ranker Pipeline Diagram Component
---

<figure class="twitter-pipe-diagram" aria-labelledby="twitter-pipe-caption">
  <svg
    class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="twitter-pipe-title twitter-pipe-desc"
  >
    <title id="twitter-pipe-title">
      Twitter (X) 為你推薦時間軸推薦管線架構
    </title>
    <desc id="twitter-pipe-desc">
      展示從 5 億則推文中透過 In-Network (Earlybird) 與 Out-of-Network
      (GraphJet/SimClusters) 檢索出 1,500 則候選推文，經由 Heavy Ranker 4800
      萬參數類神經網路評分，再通過可見性過濾與多樣性重排，最終在 1.5
      秒內渲染時間軸的完整管線。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="tpipe-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow-head"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="tpipe-arrow-accent"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"
          class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow-head--accent"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Stage 1: Candidate Retrieval (Left Column) -->
    <g class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="200" height="150" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24"
        >STAGE 01: 500M ➔ 1.5K</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title" x="16" y="50"
        >候選集檢索 (50%)</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="74"
        >• In-Network: Earlybird</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="94"
        >• Lucene 記憶體倒排索引</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="114"
        >• 追蹤者的最新動態</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag" x="16" y="136"
        >~750 則關注圈內推文</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 230)">
      <rect width="200" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24"
        >STAGE 01: 500M ➔ 1.5K</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title" x="16" y="50"
        >網絡外檢索 (50%)</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="74"
        >• Out-of-Network</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="94"
        >• GraphJet 即時圖遍歷</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="114"
        >• SimClusters 興趣社群</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="134"
        >• 矩陣分解與向量相似度</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag" x="16" y="156"
        >~750 則探索推薦推文</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrows from Stage 1 to Home Mixer -->
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 230 115 H 285"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 230 315 H 285"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 2: Home Mixer Pipeline Orchestrator -->
    <g
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card twitter-pipe-diagram__card--mixer"
      transform="translate(290, 110)"
    >
      <rect width="180" height="200" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--accent"
        x="16"
        y="24">ORCHESTRATOR</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title twitter-pipe-diagram__title--focus"
        x="16"
        y="52">Home Mixer</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• 推薦管線協調整合</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="100"
        >• 匯聚 1,500 則候選池</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="122"
        >• 特徵工程提取 (Feature Store)</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="144"
        >• 派發至 Heavy Ranker</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--accent"
        x="16"
        y="180">端到端 SLA 嚴控 &lt;1.5s</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow from Home Mixer to Heavy Ranker -->
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow--accent"
      d="M 470 210 H 515"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow-accent)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 3: Heavy Ranker (Neural Network) -->
    <g
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card twitter-pipe-diagram__card--ranker"
      transform="translate(520, 70)"
    >
      <rect width="210" height="280" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--neural"
        x="16"
        y="24">STAGE 02: 1.5K ➔ SCORED</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title twitter-pipe-diagram__title--neural"
        x="16"
        y="52">Heavy Ranker</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• 4800 萬參數 MaskNet 網路</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="100"
        >• 多任務學習 (Multi-Task):</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="24" y="122"
        >▫ P(Like) × 30</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="24" y="142"
        >▫ P(Retweet) × 1</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="24" y="162"
        >▫ P(Reply &amp; Author Engage) × 75</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="24" y="182"
        >▫ P(Report / Block) × -369</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="208"
        >• 綜合加權公式計算預期效用</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--neural"
        x="16"
        y="254">GPU 叢集低延遲推理 (&lt;50ms)</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow from Heavy Ranker to Filters & Re-ranking -->
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow--accent"
      d="M 730 210 H 775"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow-accent)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 4: Filtering & Final Timeline Output -->
    <g class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card" transform="translate(780, 40)">
      <rect width="150" height="150" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge" x="14" y="24"
        >STAGE 03: FILTER</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title" x="14" y="50">可見性過濾</text>
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="74"
        >• 封鎖 / 靜音黑名單</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="94"
        >• NSFW / 安全合規</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="114"
        >• 疲勞抑制 (Fatigue)</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag" x="14" y="136">過濾剔除 ~50%</text
      >
    </g>

    <g
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card twitter-pipe-diagram__card--output"
      transform="translate(780, 230)"
    >
      <rect width="150" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--accent"
        x="14"
        y="24">STAGE 04: OUTPUT</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title twitter-pipe-diagram__title--focus"
        x="14"
        y="50">多樣性重排</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="74"
        >• 作者多樣性交錯</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="94"
        >• 廣告 / 社交穿插</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="114"
        >• 最終推薦時間軸</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--accent"
        x="14"
        y="156">Top-N 渲染交付</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Flow connection in Stage 4 -->
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 855 190 V 225"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile Version -->
  <div class="twitter-pipe-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-card">
      <span class="twitter-pipe-mobile-badge">01. 候選檢索 (500M ➔ 1500)</span>
      <h4>雙軌候選檢索 (Candidate Sources)</h4>
      <p>
        50% 關注圈內（Earlybird 倒排索引）+ 50% 網絡外探索（GraphJet 實時圖與
        SimClusters 興趣嵌入）。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-arrow">↓ 整合 1,500 則候選推文</div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-card twitter-pipe-mobile-card--mixer">
      <span class="twitter-pipe-mobile-badge twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--accent"
        >02. 管線協調中心</span
      >
      <h4>Home Mixer 與特徵工程</h4>
      <p>
        快速聚合候選名單，提取即時用戶互動特徵，派發給深度模型進行批次推論。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-arrow">↓ 毫秒級神經網路推論</div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-card twitter-pipe-mobile-card--ranker">
      <span class="twitter-pipe-mobile-badge twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--neural"
        >03. 核心評分模型</span
      >
      <h4>Heavy Ranker (48M 參數 MaskNet)</h4>
      <p>
        預測 Like, Retweet, Reply, Engage
        等多目標機率，計算全域加權正負期望分值。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-arrow">↓ 業務合規與重排</div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-card twitter-pipe-mobile-card--output">
      <span class="twitter-pipe-mobile-badge twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--accent"
        >04. 過濾與多樣性重排</span
      >
      <h4>Visibility Filtering &amp; Heuristics</h4>
      <p>
        扣除封鎖/NSFW，防止同作者洗版，穿插廣告與推播，1.5
        秒內完成「為你推薦」渲染。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="twitter-pipe-caption">
    圖 1：Twitter (X) 推薦演算法全景管線：雙軌候選檢索、Home Mixer 協調、Heavy
    Ranker 神經網路與多樣性重排。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
